          },
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"features3 hotelm4_features3\" group=\"Features\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n\n\t<mbr-parameters>\n\t\t\n\t\t<header>Size</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"9\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\" condition=\"!fullWidth\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"9\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\" condition=\"!fullWidth\">\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Media Size\" name=\"mediaSize\" min=\"20\" max=\"100\" step=\"5\" value=\"100\" condition=\"!fullWidth\">\n\t\t<select title=\"Paragraphs Count\" name=\"paragraphsCount\" condition=\"showText\">\n\t\t\t<option value=\"1\" selected>1</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"2\">2</option>\n\t\t</select>\n\t\t<header>Show / Hide</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Underline\" name=\"showUnderline\" condition=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Underline Color\" name=\"underlineColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"showUnderline && showSubtitle\">\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Media on Left/Right\" name=\"reverseContent\">\n\t\t<header>Background</header>\n\t\t<fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background2.jpg\" parallax>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#0e7b9e\" selected>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2jqUN6d6ZyM\">\n\t\t</fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n\n\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" checked condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#000000\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\t\t\n\t</mbr-parameters>\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n\n\n\t<div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n\t</div>\n\n\t<div mbr-class=\"{'container-fluid': fullWidth,\n                    'container': !fullWidth}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"image-element\" mbr-class=\"{'col-xl-5': !fullWidth,\n                            'col-xl-6': fullWidth}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"img-wrap\" mbr-style=\"{'height': mediaSize + '%',\n                                'width': mediaSize + '%'}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/mbr-3-1919x1279.jpg\" alt=\"Villa Ioli with private pool in Evritos Villas in Karpenisi\">\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"text-element\" mbr-class=\"{'col-xl-5': !fullWidth,\n                            'col-xl-6': fullWidth}\" mbr-if=\"showTitle || showSubtitle || showText ||showButtons\">\n\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mbr-lighter mbr-white\" mbr-class=\"{'pb-3': !showUnderline}\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle, .underline\">KTΗMA ΔΡΙΛΛΗ</h3>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"underline pb-3\" mbr-if=\"showUnderline && showSubtitle\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"line\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style pb-4 mbr-white\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-1\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\">Χρυσές αμμώδεις παραλίες</h2>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"paragraphs-wrapper pb-4\" mbr-if=\"showText\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mbr-lighter\" mbr-class=\"{'first-paragraph': paragraphsCount == 2}\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">Η Νάξος φημίζεται για τις εκπληκτικές παραλίες της, προσφέροντας κάτι για όλους, από ζωντανά, οργανωμένα σημεία μέχρι ήσυχους, παρθένους όρμους. Ακολουθούν οι πιο δημοφιλείς παραλίες του νησιού:<br><br>Άγιος Προκόπιος, Αγία Άννα, Παραλία Πλάκα, Μικρή Βίγλα, Ορκός, Αλυκό, Καστράκι, Πυργάκι, Απόλλωνας, Αγιάσος.<br><br>Χαρακτηριστικά: Το παρθένο περιβάλλον και η γαλήνια τοποθεσία.<br>Κάθε παραλία στη Νάξο προσφέρει τη μοναδική της γοητεία, καθιστώντας το νησί έναν παράδεισο για τους λάτρεις της παραλίας. Είτε προτιμάτε μια πολύβουη ατμόσφαιρα είτε μια γαλήνια μοναξιά, θα βρείτε το ιδανικό μέρος!</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"second-paragraph mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mbr-lighter\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"paragraphsCount == 2\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tEnjoy entertainment with three televisions as well as high-speed Wi-Fi in each villa. Additional amenities like floor heating, free parking and cleaning service further enhance your stay. One of the true highlights is the natural stone terrace. With the private pool and BBQ area in each villa, nothing stands in the way of pure relaxation.</p>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-buttons data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\"><a class=\"btn btn-lg btn-warning\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" href=\"page1.html#header6-0\">More information</a></div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section>",
